WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.103
The race's world now has riders in it: everyone you race, drawn where they are on

00:00:07.103 --> 00:00:07.961
the route.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.279
Race the bots, and each one rides in view in its own jersey colour, the same colour

00:00:15.279 --> 00:00:17.250
as its dot on the standings.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:25.466
Race solo, and your best ride comes back as a ghost: your shape on a bike, in

00:00:25.466 --> 00:00:27.581
translucent gold, beside you.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:35.653
Each rider keeps a line of its own across the road, cuts to the inside of a bend,

00:00:35.653 --> 00:00:36.993
and leans into it.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:46.378
Every rider is main's cyclist kit, the same bike and rider you ride. main had no

00:00:46.378 --> 00:00:50.045
ghost, so it is drawn new from the kit, in its style.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:55.346
From a phone to a desktop, the field rides ahead of you on the road.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:06.761
What the tests prove: the renderer reports the riders it drew, in their jersey

00:01:06.761 --> 00:01:11.695
colours, at their places, and the ghost translucent gold. No pixel is read.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:16.869
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:17.214 --> 00:01:21.726
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:21.726 --> 00:01:23.397
every hill and interval.

00:01:23.742 --> 00:01:28.920
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:34.368
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:34.368 --> 00:01:37.358
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:37.704 --> 00:01:40.196
A custom workout lives under Profile.
